STD — Smart Task Distributor (reference sources, patches, scripts, docs).

License: GPL-2.0, to match the Linux kernel tree it patches.
See the kernel COPYING file (GPL version 2) in linux-fresh-7.3/COPYING
and the SPDX headers in src/std.c and src/std.h.

No additional restrictions are imposed by the STD scripts or docs.
Installer/uninstaller/cleanup helpers run privileged steps only via
`sudo -n` (fail-closed) and never auto-upgrade the license.
